    <note>
      <content>
        <p>Each record and seed generates eight different protein-only synonymous initializations, all evaluated by the real scorer.</p>
        <p>The first arm selects pool index zero; the best arm selects maximum search utility with lowest-index tie breaking.</p>
        <p>The selected start is cached and only three new local-search points are added, preserving an exact budget of eleven unique outputs.</p>
        <p>The three frozen primary families use record-level inference and require both endpoints to pass.</p>
        <p>Source: RK41 independent b402c4fd4899 · clean closeout af5ad2580151.</p>
        <p>Independent verification: 5,401 checks; clean closeout: 1,114 checks; full project tests: 494 passed, one skipped, five subtests passed.</p>
        <p>Coverage: 324 runs, 3,564 raw points, 216 complete new trajectories and 1,604 independently rescored unique sequences.</p>
        <p>Internal proxy improvements do not establish external SOTA, functional efficacy, protein OOD, untouched-confirmation success or manuscript-submittable status.</p>
      </content>
    </note>
